sequenceDiagram
    participant EvalHub as eval-hub Service
    participant Adapter as Garak Adapter Pod
    participant Sidecar as eval-hub Sidecar<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant KFP as Kubeflow Pipelines API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant S3 as S3-Compatible Store<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Target as Target LLM Model<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant SDGModel as SDG LLM Model<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant AttackLLM as Attacker LLM<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant JudgeLLM as Judge LLM<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant OCI as OCI Registry<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MLflow as MLflow<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over EvalHub,Adapter: Flow 1: Simple Mode Scan
        EvalHub->>Adapter: Mount JobSpec ConfigMap<br/>/etc/eval-job/spec.json
        Adapter->>Adapter: Parse JobSpec, resolve config<br/>deep-merge benchmark profiles
        Adapter->>Target: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (API key)
        Note right of Target: Garak probes execute<br/>vulnerability scans
        Target-->>Adapter: Model responses
        Adapter->>Adapter: Parse JSONL/AVID results<br/>compute TBSA scores
        Adapter->>Sidecar: POST result callback<br/>HTTP plaintext (loopback)<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
        Sidecar->>OCI: Push artifact bundle<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+
        Sidecar->>MLflow: Log metrics & artifacts<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over Adapter,S3: Flow 2: KFP Mode Scan
        Adapter->>KFP: Create Pipeline Run<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: SA Token
        Note over KFP: 6-step pipeline executes

        KFP->>S3: validate: check connectivity<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: AWS IAM
        S3-->>KFP: OK

        KFP->>SDGModel: sdg_generate: generate prompts<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
        SDGModel-->>KFP: Generated adversarial prompts

        KFP->>S3: prepare_prompts: upload<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: AWS IAM

        KFP->>Target: garak_scan: scan target<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
        Target-->>KFP: Scan results

        KFP->>S3: write_outputs: upload results<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: AWS IAM
        S3-->>KFP: Upload confirmed

        loop Poll for completion
            Adapter->>KFP: GET run status<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: SA Token
            KFP-->>Adapter: Run status
        end

        Adapter->>S3: Download scan results<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: AWS IAM
        S3-->>Adapter: JSONL, AVID, HTML reports
        Adapter->>Sidecar: POST result callback<br/>HTTP plaintext (loopback)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 230, 230)
        Note over Adapter,JudgeLLM: Flow 3: Intents Benchmark (KFP)
        Adapter->>KFP: Create Intents Pipeline Run<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+

        KFP->>S3: resolve_taxonomy: fetch taxonomy<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: AWS IAM

        KFP->>SDGModel: sdg_generate: generate from taxonomy<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Bearer Token

        KFP->>S3: prepare_prompts: upload SDG output<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: AWS IAM

        KFP->>AttackLLM: TAPIntent: generate attacks<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
        AttackLLM-->>KFP: Attack prompts

        KFP->>Target: garak_scan: probe target<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
        Target-->>KFP: Target responses

        KFP->>JudgeLLM: MulticlassJudge: evaluate<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
        JudgeLLM-->>KFP: Evaluation verdicts

        KFP->>S3: write_outputs: persist results<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: AWS IAM

        Adapter->>S3: Download final results
        Adapter->>Sidecar: POST result callback
    end
